<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Nippon Denwa Shisetsu Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured due 2003.</p>
<p>AG Ajikawa Corp, 20 million Swiss Francs unsecured due 2001, private placement, guaranteed by Dai-ichi Kangyo Bank.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Watt Mann Co Ltd, three billion euroyen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Hankyu Corp, 10 billion euroyen unsecured cnovertible due 2006.</p>
</text>
